  "changelog": "Team QA 1.17.0, QA GUI 2.18.0, QA Code 1.11.2 and the Dragon runtime 1.7.0.\n\nA Buzz agent session can run Team QA, with the plan approved by a signed Buzz message in the job thread. teamqa board publish --to colab puts the QA board on Doc-Colab: one task board per run, evidence uploaded, the doc read back and checked before the link is given.\n",
